<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo ups 8-yr Pfandbrief to 1.5 bln DEM.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo ups 8-yr Pfandbrief to 1.5 bln DEM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25 PCT  MATURITY    25.FEB 05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.40     PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  31 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p>NOTES  *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN DEM ON 14.FEB.97  </p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  23 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
